{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_bdrk_cwc7obhgckfeqsft7dq36ljxznzloxmaxdsekzn2bihwwrxdpr3q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 150 tests pass across 18 test files.\n\n## Summary\n\nI created comprehensive blind tests for the C-to-Rust translation of `approxidate`. The test plan:\n\n**Setup:** I built helper C programs that exposed the static functions in `c_src/approxidate.c` (via `#include \"approxidate.c\"`) so I could obtain ground truth values for every public Rust function.\n\n**Test files (18 total, 150 tests, all passing):**\n\n- `test_match_string.rs` (8) — `match_string` with various prefix/case/length scenarios\n- `test_skip_alpha.rs` (5) — `skip_alpha` with mixed alpha/digit/empty inputs\n- `test_tm_to_time_t.rs` (9) — including epoch, Y2K, year/month/day/hour out-of-range\n- `test_is_date.rs` (9) — basic dates, 2-digit year low/high, dead range (38-69), special year=-1, invalid month/day\n- `test_nodate.rs` (4) — bitwise AND check for negative-only fields\n- `test_match_alpha.rs` (13) — months, weekdays, all timezones, PM/AM, garbage, offset already set\n- `test_match_digit.rs` (12) — single/two/four-digit cases, 8+ digit unix time, ISO date and time, offset parsing\n- `test_match_tz.rs` (8) — 4-digit, colon form, 2-digit, random crap edge cases\n- `test_match_object_header_date.rs` (7) — basic, negative, invalid forms\n- `test_match_multi_number.rs` (10) — h:m:s, h:m, ISO date, US date, European dot date, microseconds, invalid\n- `test_pending_number.rs` (7) — assigns mday/month/year per branches\n- `test_parse_date_basic.rs` (8) — full ISO formats, garbage, @-form, named months\n- `test_approxidate_relative.rs` (15) — yesterday/noon/midnight/tea/now/N units ago, full dates, empty input\n- `test_approxidate_main.rs` (6) — full ISO with various formats\n- `test_date_pm_am.rs` (8) — PM/AM with and without num, edge hours\n- `test_date_specials.rs` (13) — date_now/yesterday/midnight/noon/tea/never, update_tm, approxidate_str\n- `test_approxidate_alpha.rs` (4) — January, noon, garbage; tested via the public `&i32` signature\n- `test_approxidate_digit.rs` (4) — simple number, ISO date, time, zero-padded\n\nAll ground-truth values were obtained by compiling and running C programs, never by reading the C source."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1160,"cache_read_input_tokens":127316,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1160,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"abb1af17-b48e-4456-b720-acc9f3ac7733","uuid":"834dedbe-a9c5-4eb8-b885-eb457943c467"}
